<title>EGYPT: Egypt says seeks 10,000 to 20,000 T vegoils.</title>
<headline>Egypt says seeks 10,000 to 20,000 T vegoils.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's official Holding Company for Food Industries said on Monday it was seeking 10,000 to 20,000 tonnes of crude sunflower and/or semi-refined cottonseed oil for delivery in the second half of September.</p>
<p>Muharram Ghanem, head of the sales sector, told Reuters the deadline for bids was August 19.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1 mf</p>
</text>
